==========================================================
TUTOR REGISTRATION
==========================================================

Tutor registers using

POST

/api/v1/auth/register/tutor

Gateway forwards request to Auth Service.

Auth Service creates

UserCredential

Fields

email

password

role = ROLE_TUTOR

accountStatus = PENDING

enabled = true

createdAt

updatedAt

Password must be BCrypt encrypted.

Registration MUST NOT generate JWT.

Return

201 Created

Example

{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Registration completed successfully. Please login to continue.",
    "data": {

        "userId":"...",

        "email":"...",

        "role":"ROLE_TUTOR",

        "accountStatus":"PENDING"

    }
}

==========================================================
LOGIN
==========================================================

Tutor logs in

POST

/api/v1/auth/login

Gateway forwards request.

Auth Service verifies credentials.

If successful

Generate JWT.

JWT must include

userId

email

role

accountStatus

issuedAt

expiration

Return

{
    "success": true,
    "message":"Login successful.",
    "data":{

        "accessToken":"...",

        "tokenType":"Bearer",

        "expiresIn":3600,

        "userId":"...",

        "role":"ROLE_TUTOR",

        "accountStatus":"PENDING"

    }

}

JWT must ONLY be generated after successful login.

